+# Flight Logbook
+
+> Institutional memory. Concise, factual, high-signal.
+> Newest entries first. One block per insight.
+
+## 2026-09-05
+
+### 1733 — Signature verification needs the repo allowed-signers file
+- ANOMALY: global `gpg.ssh.allowedSignersFile` points at stale `/private/tmp/curator-spec-rc8-verify.*`; bare `git log --show-signature` prints "No principal matched".
+- FIX: verify with `git -c gpg.ssh.allowedSignersFile=maintainers.allowed_signers log --show-signature`; commit `5da9b95` verifies `G` for oparin@me.com.
+- STATUS: machine config, not repo; pending operator cleanup.
+
+### 1732 — environments.md 1.1 readings fixed by the vectors, not the text
+- FINDING: §5.8 `codex_cli` TOML "no other bytes" read as no blank line between `[mcp_servers.<name>]` tables (`tools/generate-vectors/environments.go` `environmentMCPFiles`).
+- FINDING: §7.8 opencode MCP descriptor emitted as `variable OPENCODE_CONFIG` with no `argument`; §7.3 defines `argument` for `flag` only.
+- FINDING: §5 emits a `## Context:` chapter for a lone root with modules; v1 vectors omitted it.
+- FINDING: "two exact constraints must peel to one commit" and core §7 cycles name no diagnostic; vector uses `context_range_conflict` for the former, no cycle case.
+- FINDING: §9.1 pattern classes unnamed in text; fixed as `aws-access-key-id`, `private-key-block`, `bearer-token` with placeholder rule (`tools/generate-vectors/context_detectors.go`).
+- STATUS: candidate errata for the text owner; TASK-260905-1xkxe4 drafting report has the full list.
+
+### 1731 — Section 13 conformance surfaces delivered
+- MILESTONE: commit `5da9b95` on `task-board/story/STORY-260905-1z93ju`: 3 new schemas, 2 rewritten, 2 withdrawn; `context-versions.json`, `context-detectors.json`, `environments.json` v2 regenerated.
+- FINDING: `make validate` and `make regenerate-check` green; 63/63 range-satisfies pairs agree with node-semver 7.7.4; 4 desugar spelling-only differences (`=1.2.3`, `^0`).
+- SCOPE: `schemas/v1/`, `conformance/v1/`, `tools/generate-vectors/`, `tools/validate.py`, `tools/test_validate.py`.
